2026-07-28T06:59:05.6093501Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T06:59:05.6094078Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
